OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in single-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ain Aberdeenshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man has died after a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle car crash in
OL,8,FAberdeenshire.
OL,10,FThe crash involving a black Toyota
OL,11,FYaris happened on the B9119, two miles
OL,12,Feast of Tarland, at about 18:25 on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe man, who was a passenger in the
OL,16,Fcar, was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe 26-year-old woman who was driving
OL,19,Fand two other passengers, both aged 22,
OL,20,Fwere taken to Aberdeen Royal Infirmary
OL,21,Fbefore being discharged.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
